  m_Body: \n\n\n\n\n\n\nI'm not kidding. She found him in the closet behind\nthe conference room totally blitzed. I guess he\nsneaks a drink back there whenever he's stressed.\n\nIf you want to catch him just pop in some time\nwhen the door is locked.\n\nThe code is 5050, everyone knows that.
